#HELPS
1 BALMORA~
Balmora is a prosperous Hlaalu city built across both banks of the Odai River,
where stone bridges link Labor Town, busy market and the heights of High Town.
Adobe homes crowd both banks as traders, workers and guards fill broad streets
and dusty roads lead outward toward four neighboring regions.~
